          "_comment": "Air-mass continuity, dm/dt = -(divh_fix + D(Mz, lev)). NOTE divh_fix, NOT the raw D(Mx,lon)+D(My,lat): Mz is DIAGNOSED by integrating -(dB[k]*dPSdt + divh_fix[k]) up the column, so its own difference D(Mz,lev)_k = Mz[k+1]-Mz[k] already carries the corrected horizontal divergence. Pairing that with the RAW divergence here leaves the correction uncancelled and dm/dt inherits it verbatim: dm_k/dt = dB[k]*dPSdt + (divh_fix - divh)_k, i.e. a residual (-dPSdt - divh_col)*dp_k/dp_col whose dp-RELATIVE size (-dPSdt - divh_col)/dp_col is the SAME at every level. That is exactly what was measured before this line was changed -- 3.0e-6 1/s rms, constant down each column to 1e-11, indistinguishable between interior and wall cells, and unmoved by halving the step. With divh_fix here the two cancel term for term and dm_k/dt = dB[k]*dPSdt to roundoff.\n\nWHAT THIS MEANS PHYSICALLY. The column budget is over-determined: sum_k dm_k/dt is pinned to -divh_col by the no-flux top and bottom walls whatever Mz does, while the target sums to dPSdt. GEOS-FP's time-AVERAGED A3 winds and INSTANTANEOUS I3 surface pressure do not agree, so divh_col != -dPSdt and no choice of vertical flux can satisfy both. Making m track dp therefore REQUIRES a mass source of exactly that imbalance (~4e-6 1/s, ~1.3% of column mass per hour here). This form absorbs it, distributed by dp weight. It does NOT touch composition: the species stay in CWC mixing-ratio form dq/dt = [-div(Mq) + q div(M)]/m with the RAW div(M), which is precisely the mixing-ratio equation implied by carrying the source at the local mixing ratio (d(mq)/dt = -(div(Mq) + c*q) together with dm/dt = -(div(M) + c) gives back this equation with the c terms cancelling identically). So q == 1 still holds bitwise -- see tools/cwc_gate.jl.\n\nThe alternative -- eliminating the source rather than absorbing it -- means adjusting Mx and My so divh_col == -dPSdt, which is a 2-D Poisson solve for a velocity potential (Jockel et al. 2001), not a column-local operation. That is a bigger change and is NOT what this is.",
          "lhs": {
            "op": "D",
            "args": [
              "m"
            ],
            "wrt": "t"
          },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  "divh_fix",
                  {
                    "op": "D",
                    "args": [
                      "Mz"
                    ],
                    "wrt": "lev"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
