          "description": "NEI2016 FORM emission rate for SuperFast.CH2O, ppb/s, in the surface layer only. Chain: the regridded month-integrated flux density E_FORM / days_in_month -> a true per-second flux; / (delp/g0) [kg/m^2] -> kg/kg/s; x 1e9*MW_air/MW_species -> ppb/s. The unit factor is spelled 1e9*0.02897/0.030026 so its provenance stays legible: it is uconv/MW_X from GasChem.jl couple2(SuperFastCoupler, NEI2016MonthlyEmisCoupler), the same constant EarthSciModels/couplings/nei2016_superfast.esm carries. The upstream component's dimensionless Dz placeholder is dropped (it is 1.0 there, and a no-op).",
